#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:1 docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Habitat RPC"
msgstr "Habitat RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Habitat RPC** is the **single business channel** between Habitat clients and the agent runtime. The TypeScript constant is `HABITAT_RPC_VERSION`; the wire connect literal may still accept the historical value `\"HubRPC/1.0\"` for compatibility. Transport:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:11
msgid ""
"**WebSocket** — long-lived connection at **`/rpc/v1`** (connect handshake + "
"heartbeat; Habitat RPC `req`/`res`/`evt` envelope)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:11
msgid ""
"**HTTP REST** — stateless GET/POST at **`/rpc/v1/{method/path}`** (plain "
"JSON body or query; `Authorization: Bearer`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:13
msgid ""
"Implemented in [`src/shared/habitat-rpc/`](../../src/shared/habitat-rpc/) "
"(WS envelope + HTTP REST helpers) and [`src/platform/habitat/http-rest-"
"router.ts`](../../src/platform/habitat/http-rest-router.ts) (HTTP adapter). "
"Feature method schemas live under [`src/shared/rpc-contract/`](../../src/"
"shared/rpc-contract/)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:15
msgid ""
"Binary HTTP methods (e.g. `tts.synthesize`, companion assets, TLS PEM/QR) "
"use Habitat RPC REST with registry `request` / `response` encoding. Public "
"probes (`health.probe`, `tls.ca.*`) are Habitat RPC methods with `auth: "
"optional`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tools: MCP first, remote registration rare"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability        | Description                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| `memory_recall`   | Four sources: semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; conversation returns snippet |\n"
#| "| `sessions_search` | Session message search; returns snippet (not full content)                                             |\n"
#| "| `memory_remember` | Semantic memory CRUD during conversation                                                               |\n"
#| "| Resident memory   | System prompt injection (not recall)                                                                   |\n"
msgid ""
"| Situation                                                    | Mechanism                                                             |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Peer is dialable (has a stable inbound MCP/HTTP listener)    | **MCP** — expose tools to each other                                  |\n"
"| Product UI (Chat, Task, Settings, …)                         | Habitat RPC only — **no** remote-tool attach                          |\n"
"| Unreachable local app (no inbound listener Habitat can dial) | App **actively connects** and registers remote tools over Habitat RPC |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力              | 说明                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | 四源：semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical；Top N；conversation 返回 snippet            |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | 会话消息搜索；返回 snippet（非全文）                                                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | 对话中语义记忆 CRUD                                                                                    |\n"
"| Resident memory   | system prompt 注入（非 recall）                                                                        |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/habitat-rpc.md:25
msgid ""
"Desktop companion is the in-tree example of the third row. Future "
"independent local apps may do the same without being a Portal shell."
msgstr ""

